:: StoryTitle
Sample Fork — VG Sketch

:: Start
You stand at a fork in a dry riverbed. Heat shimmers over the stones. Two trails continue: one toward a dark notch in the cliff, one toward a cluster of white tents.

[[Enter the notch|Notch]]
[[Approach the tents|Tents]]

:: Notch
Cool air. Scratches on the wall look deliberate — three marks, then a pause, then three again.

[[Press deeper|Deeper]]
[[Back to the fork|Start]]

:: Tents
Canvas snaps in the wind. Someone has left a kettle and a folded map weighted with a stone. No one answers your call.

[[Read the map|Map]]
[[Back to the fork|Start]]

:: Deeper
The passage narrows. You hear water — or breathing. The sketch ends here; leave a note for the next writer.

[[Return to the fork|Start]]

:: Map
The map shows the riverbed and a mark inland labeled only "gate." Useful seed for a longer piece.

[[Return to the fork|Start]]
